---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import CallToAction from '../components/CallToAction.astro';
import { organizationSchema, serviceSchema } from '../data/schema';
---
<BaseLayout title="Personality Coaching: Discover & Develop | Threads Coaching" description="Understand your personality patterns and build a development plan that fits through personality coaching." path="/personality-discover-develop" schema={[organizationSchema, serviceSchema('Personality coaching: Discover and Develop', '/personality-discover-develop', 'Personality coaching to help people understand patterns and build a practical development plan.')] }>
  <section class="hero-copy section"><div class="container narrow"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Personality coaching' }]} /><p class="eyebrow">Discover &amp; develop</p><h1>Understand your unique wiring—and turn insight into growth.</h1><p class="lead">Explore your personality through Jungian cognitive functions and the 16 personalities framework, then turn what you discover into a development plan that genuinely fits.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact">Ask about personality coaching</a></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Advice works better when it starts with who you actually are.</h2><p>Understanding how you naturally process information, make decisions and relate to others can give you clearer language for your strengths, blind spots and next edges of growth.</p><p>This is a developmental tool, not a clinical assessment, diagnosis or fixed label.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container card-grid"><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Discover</p><h2>Put language to your unique wiring.</h2><p>A focused one-off session helps you explore your likely personality pattern and what it means for life, leadership and relationships.</p></article><article class="card"><p class="eyebrow">Develop</p><h2>Turn insight into practice.</h2><p>A five-session development package creates room to work with your strengths, notice your blind spots and practise new ways of responding.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>What you can take from the process</h2><ul><li>Clearer language for your natural preferences and patterns.</li><li>A better understanding of strengths and blind spots.</li><li>More thoughtful choices about relationships, work and development.</li><li>A plan that is shaped around your context, not a generic type label.</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Not sure whether this is the right place to begin?</h2><p>Personality coaching can sit alongside wider <a href="/one-to-one-sessions">one-to-one coaching</a>. Start a conversation and we can help you decide what would be most useful.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Questions about personality coaching</h2><details><summary>Is this a psychological assessment?</summary><p>No. It is a developmental coaching tool, not a clinical assessment, diagnosis or fixed label.</p></details><details><summary>Can I begin with one session?</summary><p>Yes. The Discover session is designed as a focused starting point; the Develop pathway is available if deeper follow-on work feels useful.</p></details></div></section>
  <CallToAction title="Get curious about what helps you thrive." body="Ask about a Discover session or a longer development pathway." primaryHref="/contact" primaryLabel="Ask about personality coaching" />
</BaseLayout>
